{"ref":"BDB, קָרַן","hw":"קָרַן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קָרַן</span></big>  <strong>vb.</strong><br><strong>Qal</strong>  <strong> denom.</strong> of <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶרֶן</span> <strong>5, send out rays</strong>;—Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">קָרַן עוֹר פָּנָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:29\" href=\"/Exodus.34.29\">Ex 34:29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:30\" href=\"/Exodus.34.30\">30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:35\" href=\"/Exodus.34.35\">35</a> (P). <strong>Hiph.denom.</strong> of <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶרֶן</span> <strong>1 a,</strong> display (grow) <strong>horns</strong> (be fully developed), Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּר מַקְרִן מַפְרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:32\" href=\"/Psalms.69.32\">ψ 69:32</a>.","next":"BDB, קֶרֶן הַפּוּךְ","prev":"BDB, קֶ֫רֶן"}